# The repo-root .gitignore carries a .NET/Visual-Studio rule (`**/[Bb]in/*`,
# "Build results on 'Bin' directories") that would ignore this package's runner
# source. `bin/` here holds a committed Dart executable (bin/ssreconvert.dart,
# the `dart run ssgen_flutter:ssreconvert` host runner), so re-include it.
!bin/
!bin/*.dart
